cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
title: "ReHealth HealthAgent"
abstract: >-
  A small, deterministic simulator of how adherence, emotion and physiology
  interact over a behavioural health intervention. It provides an optional
  LLM-based adherence backend, a reproducible offline rule model, a CLI, a
  FastAPI service and a pytest suite. Research and illustration only; not a
  medical device and not clinical advice.
version: "0.2.0"
